      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 13, touch 9, flat-footed 13 (-1 dex, +4 natural)</p><p>hp 34 [48] (4d8+16)</p><p>mp 6</p><p>Fort +4, Ref +0, Will +1</p><p>Immune Element of its type, Ooze traits;</p><p>Resist Forward element of its type by 50%, Physical 50%;</p><p>Weakness Opposite element of its type</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.</p><p>Melee Slam +7 (1d6+6 plus elemental damage 1d4)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Critical Attack</p><p>Spells Known (FC CL 4th; Concentration +6)</p><p>1st (DC 13) - Dark Flan (Dark), Divine Flan (Light), Earth Flan (Stone), Fire Flan (Fire), Ice Flan (Blizzard), Lightning Flan (Thunder), Water Flan (Water), Wind Flan (Aero)</p><p>2nd (DC 14) - Dark Flan (Dark II), Divine Flan (Light II), Earth Flan (Stone II), Fire Flan (Fire II), Ice Flan (Blizzard II), Lightning Flan (Thunder II), Water Flan (Water II), Wind Flan (Aero II)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 18, Dex 8, Con 17, Int 4, Wis 11, Cha 14</p><p>Base Atk +3; CMB +7; CMD 16 (cannot be tripped)</p><p>Feats Improved Initiative, Toughness</p><p>Skills Perception +4</p>"
